    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6a03a4ef-af6f-5f48-8617-f67e8e747e73" activityNameId="1f5b398a-5aa1-545f-b435-e30ff55e85d0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diesel, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diesel, at regional storage
Inventory for the distribution of petroleum product to the final consumer (household, car, power plant, etc.) including all necessary transports.;
Synonyms: green diesel, gasoil; 
UUID: 8c1f3817-0791-3c30-bf3e-42c31df95ccc
Transportation of product from the refinery to the end user. Operation of storage tanks and petrol stations. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents. Excluding emissions from car-washing at petrol stations.
Location: Surveys mainly for DE and CH.
Technology: Distribution of petroleum products.
Time period: Actual data for transport distances and NMVOC emissions. Some information for the year 2000. Split up of NMVOC emissions published 1989.
Production volume: 258 billion t in 2000
Sampling: Environmental reports and literature. 
Extrapolations: From single companies to average data.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8c1f3817-0791-3c30-bf3e-42c31df95ccc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
